(26)Non-irrigated arable land
(27)Olive groves
(28)Pastures
(29)Peatbogs
(30)Permanently irrigated land
(31)Port areas
(32)Rice fields
(33)Road and rail networks and associated land
(34)Salines
(35)Salt marshes
