Question: To which of the following class does the given image belong to?
Select all that apply. Possible answer choices:
(1)Agro-forestry areas
(2)Arable land
(3)Beaches, dunes, sands
(4)Broad-leaved forest
(5)Coastal wetlands
(6)Complex cultivation patterns
(7)Coniferous forest
(8)Industrial or commercial units
(9)Inland waters
